description	"Theron Shan
 
SIS Spy with many quick-kill opportunities with concealed weaponry.
 
^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Theron's Blaster Pistolsl
-- Clone Pistol (2)
-- 2 Shots
-- 100% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 100% More Velocity
-- 80%% More RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Stun Blade
-- Red/Staff Style Saber
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- No Saber Defense
-- Pulses/Cripples
- Saboteur Charge (3)
-- Detpack
-- Ignites, 20%+ Damage
-- Very Large Radius
- Flash Mine 
-- Tripmine (2)
-- Flash Effect
- Smoke Grenades (3)
-- Frag Grenades
-- Smoke Screen On Detonation 

^8Attributes:
- Cloak (2)
- Disguise (3)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti MT (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- 50% Faster Hack Rate

^8Abilities:
- Disguise (3) ^3[Change Style Button in MELEE]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Cloak (2)
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]
- Electro Shock Wrist Blaster (Wrist Laser) ^3[CS2]
- High Impact Micro Rocket (Whistling Bird) ^3[CS3 Melee]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]"
